From 39ace0023e1f04b4e73f54bff73860fc79c362e7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 02:37:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] wire: pulling an event calls off its plans; a new time
 retimes them

Pulling an event closes its open asks, withdraws offers, and calls off
its plans in the same transaction. When an import or a team edit moves
an event's start or meeting offset, its plans recompute the meeting time
and cutoff and reconcile right away.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015guTYUBX4Ct5WtjQ9sW1zv
---
 convex/_generated/api.d.ts | 2 ++
 convex/events/admin.ts     | 7 ++++---
 convex/events/imports.ts   | 4 ++--
 convex/plans/release.ts    | 4 ++--
 convex/plans/retime.ts     | 2 +-
 5 files changed, 11 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)

diff --git a/convex/_generated/api.d.ts b/convex/_generated/api.d.ts
